domain CC319:
  description "Persist the exact owner acceptance and prepare remote continuation."
evidence OWNER:
  |
    In this conversation on 2026-09-29 the owner answered the disclosed exact
    candidate package question: この候補一式を採用して進める（推奨）.
    The next user instruction is to create handoff materials, commit WIP if dirty,
    and push. No new implementation is needed for that closeout instruction.
evidence CANDIDATE:
  |
    Current requirement v2, ADR0039 think/md and design v2 bytes match the four
    SHA256 identities in cc305-plan-verification-2026-09-29.json. Independent
    review was completed before this exact owner question. ADR0039 only replaces
    old unfinished-battle preservation clauses for its R3 cutover target set.
premise BOUNDARY:
  |
    Preserve accepted decision content and record lifecycle metadata plus the
    exact submitted identities and owner answer. Keep ADR0010's other authoring
    and finished-history obligations active. Preserve the archived old ADR0032
    source branch, and identify its limited replacement in the new acceptance.
    Owner review duration was not measured; do not invent a start or velocity.
    Child vt111 is only the measured local readback of this accepted handoff.
decision RECORD based_on OWNER, CANDIDATE, BOUNDARY:
  |
    Record requirement/ADR/design acceptance, update their metadata and ADR index,
    and read back all identities. Record cc319 done with acceptance as evidence;
    complete the bounded vt111 readback and leave vt102 suspended for continuation.
    Preserve vt109's observed velocity sample without adding owner review or
    handoff bookkeeping as throughput. Recheck both PERT plans, write the handoff,
    commit approved WIP on existing cc304, push that branch and independently
    compare the server SHA with local HEAD. No new branches or remote data writes.
